From 9087a10053b9241df1227d99189a288a4ee9b25c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 01:58:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(delegation): label profile children, degrade provenance
 on older owners [daveey]

Profile-route children record delegation_default (they run the profile's own
model). A worker reserving a child on an older owner (payload must be exactly
{'secret'}) retries once without provenance on the bare invalid_params refusal.
Direct-build fallback now checks caller pin before delegation default. Adds
tests for continuation rows and the /review route.
---
